  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The compound(s) that is(are) removed as slag during the extraction of copper is :</p><p>(1) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CaO</mi></math></p><p>(2) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FeO</mi></math></p><p>(3) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p>(4) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ZnO</mi></math></p><p>(5) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NiO</mi></math></p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;only",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;only",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;Only",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;only",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Copper ores contain iron as the main impurity. Iron react with silica and is removed as slag. Therefore, the slag formed in the blast furnace is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeSiO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>The reaction that takes place in the blast furnace is as follows:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FeO</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>SiO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>FeSiO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>(slag)</p></blockquote>"
  }
